        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    contributions = {\n        2015: 6000,\n        2016: 7500,\n        2017: 6000\n    }\n    annual_limits = {\n        2015: 5500,\n        2016: 5500,\n        2017: 5500\n    }\n    monthly_penalty_rate = 0.01\n    penalty_months = 12\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    total_penalty = 0.0\n\n    for year, contribution in contributions.items():\n        over_contribution = max(0, contribution - annual_limits[year])\n        total_penalty += over_contribution * monthly_penalty_rate * penalty_months\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(total_penalty, 2)\n```",
